# NOTE: google-services.json and GoogleService-Info.plist are deliberately NOT
# ignored here. EAS Build excludes gitignored files from the upload, so ignoring
# them breaks every iOS and Android build with a missing-file error. They stay
# untracked instead — out of the repo, but still uploaded to the builder.
